  "ruleText": "Int 101.01 \"'Board\" means the New Hampshire board of licensure of interpreters for the deaf and hard of hearing created by RSA 326-I:2 and also comprehends the term “board of licensing of interpreters for the deaf and hard of hearing” as used in RSA 326-I:3\n\nSource. #7851, eff 3-12-03; ss by #9942, INTERIM, eff 6-18-11, EXPIRED: 12-15-11\n\nNew. #10040-A, eff 12-16-11",
